#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:2 9ed4cb50ec4040e9916ed44d4ceb9b2f
msgid "transfer-orbit-design 架构设计"
msgstr "transfer-orbit-design Architecture"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:4 bf0430af047c4866bc00b9ea74dee194
msgid "本文描述 transfer-orbit-design（以下简称 tod）的**最终形态**架构。逐项架构决策见 `docs/adr/`。"
msgstr "This document describes the **final-form** architecture of transfer-orbit-design (tod for short). Individual architecture decisions are recorded in `docs/adr/`."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:6 c60cbedebc63479b89ec92adb60110d8
msgid "总体定位"
msgstr "Overall Positioning"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:8 44cc167738e6435e9e619d33c0749162
msgid "tod 是 **e2m2e 的 GUI 前端**。它不实现任何轨道力学算法，只做三件事："
msgstr "tod is the **GUI frontend of e2m2e**. It implements no orbital-mechanics algorithms itself and does exactly three things:"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:10 3927ab9807a84c94ba58c6e9b124d5ba
msgid ""
"**调用**：通过 e2m2e Facade API "
"发起计算任务（任务轨道设计、轨道族生成、轨道保持、轨道预报、转移轨道设计、稳定性分析、时空坐标转换）。"
msgstr "**Invoke**: run computation tasks through the e2m2e Facade API (orbit design, orbit family generation, station keeping, orbit propagation, transfer design, stability analysis, spacetime transforms)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:11 8a0b0ceeb0724a34a65916349e2fd4f2
msgid "**管理**：追踪用户工作会话中的全部计算产物（轨道、轨道族、转移结果），提供结构化的数据导航和管线串联。"
msgstr "**Manage**: track every product of the working session (orbits, families, transfer results) with structured data navigation and pipeline chaining."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:12 da7f9905c323411a94d47e2e730d27e5
msgid "**呈现**：将计算结果以内嵌可视化的方式展示在主窗口中，支持 3D/2D 轨道图、多轨道叠加、地月系统标注。"
msgstr "**Present**: display results via embedded visualization in the main window — 3D/2D orbit plots, multi-orbit overlay, Earth–Moon system annotations."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:14 d26c57fb638f442587bfbbf2be333cc2
msgid "用户不需要知道 e2m2e 的内部结构，也不需要手动管理文件路径。tod 把 e2m2e 的能力封装为选工件 → 选操作 → 看结果的三步交互。"
msgstr "Users need not know e2m2e's internals or manage file paths by hand. tod wraps e2m2e's capabilities into a three-step interaction: pick an artifact → pick an operation → read the result."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:16 16f79b3f536c4b8cacd776faacc5320d
msgid "总体分层"
msgstr "Overall Layering"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:18 8431fd20b2564126bc5a9151195a1fc6
msgid ""
"自 ADR-0014 起，GUI 为 Tauri 架构（Rust 壳 + React 前端），e2m2e 经 sidecar 子进程驱动（协议 ="
" e2m2e ADR 0035：信封 JSON 行 + 二进制帧）。 原 PyQt 四层中的表现层/入口层已被替换，数据层与执行层的纯 "
"Python 部分 保留为领域资产。"
msgstr "Since ADR-0014 the GUI is a Tauri application (Rust shell + React frontend) driving e2m2e through a sidecar child process (protocol = e2m2e ADR 0035: envelope JSON lines + binary frames). The presentation and entry layers of the old PyQt four-layer design were replaced; the pure-Python data and execution layers remain as domain assets."

