#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 e9b087ad4c1f41fd8aae72d6d2085359
msgid ""
"sidecar 进程管理（拉起/重试/进度事件）、Tauri command、agent loop（LLM 流式 + 最小 MCP "
"client）、项目状态（内存 Artifact 容器）"
msgstr "sidecar process management (spawn/retry/progress events), Tauri commands, agent loop (LLM streaming + minimal MCP client), project state (in-memory artifact container)"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 b4d0d9d68dfd493295117691af434f3d
msgid "sidecar 协议"
msgstr "sidecar protocol"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 03a0092033e34810a78a0984c7d46fad
msgid "e2m2e 侧"
msgstr "e2m2e side"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 77fb0c51ab34440e94bca276c31a0362
msgid ""
"`serve-stdio`：信封 JSON 行 + f32/f64 二进制帧（大数组），见 e2m2e ADR 0035；`mcp-"
"serve`：标准 MCP stdio（同步计算在线程池，可并发）"
msgstr "`serve-stdio`: envelope JSON lines + f32/f64 binary frames (large arrays), see e2m2e ADR 0035; `mcp-serve`: standard MCP stdio (synchronous computations on a thread pool, concurrent)"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 483503eaec64436a99bcb748a650ff4f
msgid "领域层（Python）"
msgstr "Domain layer (Python)"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 afb573a882b44362a2ca4b73183354d3
msgid "`src/engine/`、`src/commons/`、`src/model/`"
msgstr "`src/engine/`, `src/commons/`, `src/model/`"

#: ../../source/dev/architecture.md:1 c8607690b20c45c38566d9be579f436f
msgid ""
"facade_bridge / catalog_service / 单位换算 / 内核管理，e2m2e 语义的 Python "
"侧资产，工具脚本与测试继续使用"
msgstr "facade_bridge / catalog_service / unit conversion / kernel management — Python-side assets carrying e2m2e semantics, still used by tool scripts and tests"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:38 b0d083fe475c47d9a6c3e9dff3c6b9ed
msgid "**关键机制**："
msgstr "**Key mechanisms**:"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:40 968a08c91c3f49cf9f05897d0524459a
msgid ""
"**schema 驱动表单**：工具入参 schema 构建期导出（`tools/export_tool_schemas.py` → "
"`frontend/src/toolSchemas/`），参数面板自动生成；升级 e2m2e 后重跑导出。`toolSchemas/*.json`"
" 由上游导出管线生成，其中提及的 ADR 编号均指 **e2m2e 侧编号空间**，与本仓 `docs/adr/` "
"编号无关（不改导出产物，改了会被下次导出覆盖）。"
msgstr "**Schema-driven forms**: tool input schemas are exported at build time (`tools/export_tool_schemas.py` → `frontend/src/toolSchemas/`) and the parameter panel is generated from them; re-run the export after upgrading e2m2e. `toolSchemas/*.json` comes from the upstream export pipeline — any ADR numbers mentioned there refer to the **e2m2e numbering space**, unrelated to this repo's `docs/adr/` (do not edit the exported files; the next export would overwrite the change)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:41 0768af5db13e4d749611aa830bf826ce
msgid ""
"**帧即渲染**：sidecar 二进制帧由 Rust 壳转成 JSON 数字数组过 IPC，前端重建为 `Float32Array` 直进 "
"Three.js `BufferAttribute`，无中间文件格式；族成员初态 + period 由前端 CR3BP "
"传播器重采样整条轨迹（方程对齐 e2m2e，有回归测试）。"
msgstr "**Frames straight to render**: sidecar binary frames are turned into JSON number arrays by the Rust shell across IPC, rebuilt into `Float32Array` on the frontend and fed directly into Three.js `BufferAttribute` — no intermediate file format; family-member initial states + period are resampled into full trajectories by the frontend CR3BP propagator (equations aligned with e2m2e, with regression tests)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:44 df5fedd20dc04b1f833b0c50d1e8361b
msgid ""
"**视图保持**：布局不变的重绘不重置相机；每批新轨迹数据到达做一次视图适配 （按包围盒复位相机，5% "
"余量），此后重绘保持用户视角（CONTEXT.md 领域语义）。"
msgstr "**View preservation**: repaints that do not change layout never reset the camera; each batch of new trajectory data triggers one view fit (camera reset on the bounding box, 5% margin), after which repaints keep the user's viewpoint (CONTEXT.md domain semantics)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:47 723098dffd3d4bcab679bb4d4afaa166
msgid "AI 助手链路（ADR 0022/0023/0025/0026）"
msgstr "AI Assistant Channel (ADRs 0022/0023/0025/0026)"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:49 f869e8072d7445c597b05523c3f2023c
msgid ""
"agent loop 宿主在 Rust 后端（`src-tauri/src/assistant/`：llm / prompt / store / "
"summary）：reqwest 调 OpenAI 兼容协议（SSE 流式），流式增量经 Tauri event 推前端；API key 存 OS"
" keychain（keyring crate），不进 webview JS 上下文。工具调用走独立常驻的 `mcp-serve` 进程（Rust"
" 侧 `mcp.rs` 实现 initialize / tools/list / tools/call 三个方法的最小 JSON-RPC "
"stdio client）， 进程管理沿用 ADR 0019 的懒启动＋崩溃自愈＋Job Object 兜底。并发语义： AI 只读查询（mcp-"
"serve 线程池）与画布长计算（serve-stdio 串行单例）互不 阻塞。工具结果进 LLM 上下文前过摘要层，轨迹等大数组不进上下文，只带"
" record_id 与诊断摘要；计算与改库工具的调用在前端以工具卡片分级确认， 只读查询免确认。会话以 JSONL 持久化在用户配置目录 "
"（`sessions/<id>.jsonl`），支持多会话切换与续聊回放。"
msgstr "The agent loop lives in the Rust backend (`src-tauri/src/assistant/`: llm / prompt / store / summary): reqwest calls the OpenAI-compatible protocol (SSE streaming), with stream increments pushed to the frontend via Tauri events; the API key is stored in the OS keychain (keyring crate) and never enters the webview JS context. Tool calls go through a dedicated resident `mcp-serve` process (on the Rust side, `mcp.rs` implements a minimal JSON-RPC stdio client with just initialize / tools/list / tools/call); process management reuses ADR 0019's lazy start + crash recovery + Job Object backstop. Concurrency semantics: AI read-only queries (mcp-serve thread pool) never block long canvas computations (serve-stdio serial singleton). Tool results pass through a summary layer before entering the LLM context — large arrays such as trajectories never enter the context, only record_id and a diagnostic summary; computing and mutating tool calls are confirmed tier-wise in the frontend via tool cards, while read-only queries need no confirmation. Sessions persist as JSONL in the user config directory (`sessions/<id>.jsonl`), with multi-session switching and resume replay."

