msgid "catalog 之外的产物落盘/扫描链路，只被测试消费（#415）"
msgstr "the product persistence/scan chain outside the catalog, consumed only by tests (#415)"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:104 61e9d9601f164a15815e9d3b74982c3a
msgid "第1层 数据层 `src/model/`"
