#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:106 ed2c3d1fe8e0429b989e2c21cdf16660
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "Artifact"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:108 8fb68b9764e642768216e90550b7798d
msgid "一次计算的产出物。纯数据类，不依赖 Qt 或 e2m2e。"
msgstr "The product of one computation. A pure data class, depending on neither Qt nor e2m2e."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:126 832e81b57f7a4374b1f8b9c16213c932
msgid "Project"
msgstr "Project"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:128 03c86882348f4846ae5f448215f3d9ff
msgid ""
"管理一次工作会话的全部 Artifact。**Project 不做持久化**，清单由轨道库 catalog 承担（`catalog_query` "
"供数）。"
msgstr "Manages all artifacts of one working session. **Project is not persisted**; the listing is owned by the orbit library catalog (fed by `catalog_query`)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:144 88361a125e4d4750b0d955f7fef898e8
msgid "Discovery（遗留分区扫描，已删）"
msgstr "Discovery (legacy partition scan, deleted)"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:146 dd737053a639478c8585a2beac602db0
msgid ""
"转移轨道是 catalog 分类体系之外的产物（上游入库另行立项），曾过渡期沿用 `output/transfer/` "
"目录扫描（`engine.persistence` 落盘 + `model.discovery` 恢复）；链路只被测试消费、facade "
"未接线，已随 #415 删除，复活场景的正确载体是上游 record 化（e2m2e#574）。轨道 / 族 / 星历的文件名分类正则更早已随 "
"catalog 接入删除（ADR 0008 修订 2026-08-19）。"
msgstr "Transfers are products outside the catalog taxonomy (upstream cataloging filed separately); the transitional `output/transfer/` directory scan (`engine.persistence` write + `model.discovery` restore) was consumed only by tests and never wired into the facade, and was deleted with #415 — the right vehicle for any revival is upstream record-ization (e2m2e#574). The filename-classification regexes for orbits / families / ephemerides were removed even earlier with the catalog adoption (ADR 0008 revision 2026-08-19)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:148 56437086044544559dc0b13c25b16182
msgid "第2层 执行层 `src/engine/`"
msgstr "Layer 2: Execution Layer `src/engine/`"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:150 241286f32a954a3eb7bcec7cba9f0515
msgid "FacadeBridge"
msgstr "FacadeBridge"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:152 81d1908029354239b7190763e2e2c245
msgid ""
"e2m2e Facade API 的薄封装。处理配置注入（kernel_dir / catalog_dir 经 "
"`Config`）、异常翻译、catalog 读写转发。"
msgstr "A thin wrapper over the e2m2e Facade API. Handles config injection (kernel_dir / catalog_dir via `Config`), exception translation, and catalog read/write forwarding."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:172 4d2d57a046934ce6873473f0743f502c
msgid "**关键设计**："
msgstr "**Key designs**:"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:174 7f8d95e6d684465a83d6ec2648a5922f
msgid ""
"**各计算工具统一走 Facade 门面**（issue #375，完成 ADR 0011 缓解措施 3 的既定清理）：#312 起 Facade"
" 响应携带完整几何字段（states/times/mu/ephemeris），#475（e2m2e "
"5.8.0）起产物自动入轨道库、`control_orbit` 支持 `input_record_id` 谱系输入。GUI "
"不再绕过门面直调算法层。"
msgstr "**All computation tools go through the Facade uniformly** (issue #375, completing the planned cleanup of ADR 0011 mitigation 3): since #312 Facade responses carry the full geometry fields (states/times/mu/ephemeris); since #475 (e2m2e 5.8.0) products land in the orbit library automatically and `control_orbit` accepts `input_record_id` lineage input. The GUI no longer bypasses the facade to call the algorithm layer directly."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:175 818a97bb9ced44069e7496574078a342
msgid "**周期族成员只携带初态与周期**，桥接层按周期重采样供画布渲染（catalog 族记录懒加载复用同一辅助函数）。"
msgstr "**Periodic family members carry only initial states and periods**; the bridge resamples them by period for canvas rendering (the lazy-load path for catalog family records reuses the same helper)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:176 23c0492aef5849858766fe299fa423b9
msgid ""
"**e2m2e 5.6.5 起 `design_orbit` 首参为 `DesignOrbitRequest`**（散字段不再支持），Facade"
" 校验请求；`duration` 由面板年单位换算为秒，Lissajous 固定注入 segmented 修正。"
msgstr "**Since e2m2e 5.6.5 the first argument of `design_orbit` is a `DesignOrbitRequest`** (loose fields are no longer accepted), validated by the Facade; `duration` is converted from panel years to seconds, and Lissajous always gets the segmented correction injected."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:177 1e5cde0bed6a4b30b2b4707bfaa59d33
msgid ""
"**结果 DTO（Data Transfer Object）**：可跨线程边界传递的纯数据类，不持有 e2m2e 对象引用。包含 numpy "
"数组（状态矩阵、时间向量）、标量元数据与 `record_id`（入库回执）。"
msgstr "**Result DTOs (Data Transfer Objects)**: pure data classes that cross thread boundaries without holding e2m2e object references. They carry numpy arrays (state matrix, time vector), scalar metadata and a `record_id` (the catalog receipt)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:178 2a32840a25614f3fa141f0ab83c8a64c
msgid ""
"**异常翻译**：e2m2e 异常 → 结构化错误码 + 用户友好消息（`src/engine/exceptions.py`）；Facade "
"接缝的 `e2m2e.api.OrbitError` 透传错误码。"
msgstr "**Exception translation**: e2m2e exceptions → structured error codes + user-friendly messages (`src/engine/exceptions.py`); `e2m2e.api.OrbitError` at the facade seam passes the error code through."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:180 cae1dd9ed9ca42ca84f0cb228c1372f3
msgid "CatalogService"
msgstr "CatalogService"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:182 306a9d9a01eb479f9742a2f65eea9e23
msgid ""
"轨道库的 GUI 语义层（`catalog_service.py`）：摘要 → Artifact 映射（清单）、`catalog_get` "
"懒加载填充（design 双段 / family 成员堆叠与重采样 / control 星历减 μ）、标注 / 提升 / 导出 / "
"删除转发。GUI 测试用桩 bridge 或小型真实库，不重测上游。"
msgstr "The GUI semantic layer over the orbit library (`catalog_service.py`): summary → Artifact mapping (listings), `catalog_get` lazy-load filling (design dual segments / family member stacking and resampling / control ephemeris minus μ), and annotate / promote / export / delete forwarding. GUI tests use a stub bridge or a small real library and do not re-test upstream."

