#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:225 bb9c3fbaa66a45818029eb245d98a746
msgid "可视化架构"
msgstr "Visualization Architecture"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:227 cebd9f2179194f098c1c21446e1f9f8c
msgid ""
"画布为 Three.js（`frontend/src/OrbitCanvas.tsx`），单一坐标系：会合系（质心 "
"归一化），物理单位（km）数据经单位归一入画。内容分**结果层**与**固定层** 双层（CONTEXT.md 领域语义）："
msgstr "The canvas is Three.js (`frontend/src/OrbitCanvas.tsx`), a single frame: synodic (barycentric normalized); physical-unit (km) data is unit-normalized on entry. Content is split into a **result layer** and a **pinned layer** (CONTEXT.md domain semantics):"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:242 1cd51bb7a95e4e71b8b8566c7b7da101
msgid ""
"渲染数据多条来路：族生成响应的成员初态经前端 CR3BP 传播器 （`frontend/src/cr3bp.ts`，方程对齐 "
"e2m2e，有回归测试）按 period 重采样整条 轨迹；轨道库记录经 `catalog_get` 取成员 xyz 进固定层；工具结果的轨迹数组"
" （含转移弧、星历段）经 `trajectoryParsing.ts` 按响应结构解析，位置按「et 秒 / 历元 "
"UTC」两级时刻基准（timeBasis.ts）对齐时间轴。新轨迹数据到达时自动 适配一次（按包围盒复位相机，5% "
"余量），此后重绘与设置变更保持用户视角 （视图保持）。"
msgstr "Render data has several sources: family-generation responses carry member initial states, which the frontend CR3BP propagator (`frontend/src/cr3bp.ts`, equations aligned with e2m2e, with regression tests) resamples into full trajectories by period; catalog records enter the pinned layer via `catalog_get` member xyz; tool-result trajectory arrays (transfer arcs, ephemeris segments) are parsed by `trajectoryParsing.ts` according to the response structure, with positions aligned to the timeline on the two-level time basis (\"et seconds / epoch UTC\", timeBasis.ts). Each batch of new trajectory data triggers one automatic view fit (camera reset on the bounding box, 5% margin); repaints and setting changes afterwards preserve the user's viewpoint (view preservation)."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:250 ad1bd72814ef47cb86d3a8e83e8535ea
msgid ""
"配色：携带 Jacobi 常数的轨迹按当前取值范围归一后 coolwarm 着色（附颜色条）， 无值轨迹回退颜色循环（seaborn "
"muted，chartSettings 可改）；图例逐条标注轨迹 数据系（会合无量纲 / 会合物理 km / 地心惯性 "
"km，随轨迹解析层携带）。动画导出 经 captureStream + MediaRecorder 编码 webm（画布自转 8 "
"秒），不引入编码依赖。"
msgstr "Colors: trajectories carrying a Jacobi constant are colored on the coolwarm ramp normalized to the value range currently on canvas (with a color bar); trajectories without a value fall back to the color cycle (seaborn muted, changeable in chartSettings); the legend annotates each trajectory's data frame (synodic nondimensional / synodic physical km / geocentric-inertial km, carried by the trajectory parsing layer). Animation export encodes webm via captureStream + MediaRecorder (8 seconds of canvas auto-rotation), introducing no encoder dependency."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:255 b39dbd7b05044f818ea7106f7fcad990
msgid "管线串联"
msgstr "Pipeline Chaining"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:257 4ad0989b2d904ba88101954f255ac47c
msgid ""
"产物间的因果关系经轨道库谱系指针持久化（重启不断）：下游产物记录 `source_record_id`，重启后由 `catalog_query` "
"+ `catalog_get` 恢复清单与轨迹。 全部任务工具的界面已接通（issue #398 已关闭；轨道稳定性后因上游 "
"placeholder 状态移出注册表，#416）：族生成 → 入库 → 浏览叠加的链路可用，选中产物 → 发起下游工具的输入引用经谱系记录衔接。"
msgstr "Causal links between products persist via orbit-library lineage pointers (surviving restarts): downstream products record `source_record_id`; after a restart, `catalog_query` + `catalog_get` restore the listing and trajectories. All task tools are wired in the UI (issue #398 closed; stability analysis was later moved out of the registry due to the upstream placeholder status, #416): the family generation → catalog → browse-and-overlay chain works, and input references from a selected product into downstream tools are carried by lineage records."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:261 46ff4a8a3f254029b6801bc9cfc9aada
msgid "工具范围（当前）"
msgstr "Tool Scope (Current)"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:263 2746b827bd8643268bf39f363cdd074b
msgid ""
"中栏工具面板接通 8 "
"个工具：轨道族生成、任务轨道设计、参数空间扫描（catalog_sweep）、轨道保持、轨道预报、转移轨道设计、时空坐标转换、分区边界（spatiography_boundaries，产出进画布区域图层；前端"
" `TOOL_REGISTRY` 注册，经通用 `run_tool` 通道下发；轨道稳定性因上游 placeholder "
"状态移出注册表，#416）。17 个工具 schema（含 7 个 catalog 操作与 3 个分区解析工具）已全部导出，catalog "
"操作的界面分布：query/get 服务目录浏览与轨迹叠加，sweep 在工具面板，delete 在项目树右键菜单，export "
"在筛选栏「导出包」，promote/tag 在记录详情面板。AI 助手经 mcp-serve 调用同一套 e2m2e 工具，不受注册表限制。 "
"原则不变：不承诺 GUI 承载 e2m2e 全部算法能力，需要脚本化工作流时直接使用 [e2m2e "
"CLI](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e)。"
msgstr "The middle-column tool panel wires 8 tools: orbit family generation, orbit design, parameter sweep (catalog_sweep), station keeping, orbit propagation, transfer design, spacetime transform, and spatiography boundaries (spatiography_boundaries, feeding the canvas region layer; registered in the frontend `TOOL_REGISTRY` and dispatched through the generic `run_tool` channel; stability analysis is out of the registry due to the upstream placeholder status, #416). All 17 tool schemas (including 7 catalog operations and 3 spatiography tools) are exported. Catalog operations are spread across the UI: query/get serve catalog browsing and trajectory overlay, sweep sits in the tool panel, delete in the project-tree context menu, export in the filter bar (\"Export package\"), promote/tag in the record detail panel. The AI assistant calls the same e2m2e tools via mcp-serve and is not bound by the registry. The principle stands: the GUI does not promise to host all of e2m2e's algorithmic capability — for scripted workflows use the [e2m2e CLI](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e) directly."

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:267 21671b44c97c46bf81669e547a278e5a
msgid "分发"
msgstr "Distribution"

#: ../../architecture/architecture.md:269 d7dc649381fd4492bebe3c791f80e6c7
msgid ""
"发行版为 Windows NSIS 安装器（currentUser 免管理员）与 Linux AppImage/deb： Tauri 主程序 + "
"`transfer-orbit-design-sidecar`（PyInstaller onefile 打包的 e2m2e serve-"
"stdio，`packaging/transfer_orbit_design_sidecar.spec`）+ SPICE 内核（含行星历，随 "
"Git LFS 入库），三者经 resources 映射进安装目录。分发期 Rust 壳从 resource 目录拉起 "
"sidecar（`packaged_sidecar_command`），cwd 指向 resource 根，e2m2e Config 的 "
"`kernels/`、`catalog/` 按 cwd 相对解析（可用 `SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` / "
"`E2M2E_CATALOG_DIR` 环境变量覆盖）。桌面端自动更新经 `@tauri-apps/plugin-updater` 基于 "
"GitHub Releases 的 latest.json（ADR 0018）。 发布管线见 "
"`.github/workflows/release.yml`（tag `v*` 触发：lint → 测试 → Windows NSIS 与 "
"Linux AppImage/deb 构建 → publish-updater 生成签名更新清单 latest.json → 直传 GitHub "
"Release）。版本 bump 时 `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`（ 单一来源，AboutModal 读运行时版本）与 "
"`frontend/package.json` 两处同步修改。"
msgstr "Releases are a Windows NSIS installer (currentUser, no administrator) and a Linux AppImage/deb: the Tauri main program + `transfer-orbit-design-sidecar` (the e2m2e serve-stdio packed by PyInstaller onefile, `packaging/transfer_orbit_design_sidecar.spec`) + SPICE kernels (including planetary ephemerides, committed via Git LFS) — the three mapped into the install directory via resources. In distributed builds the Rust shell spawns the sidecar from the resource directory (`packaged_sidecar_command`) with cwd at the resource root, so e2m2e Config's `kernels/` and `catalog/` resolve relative to cwd (overridable via the `SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` / `E2M2E_CATALOG_DIR` environment variables). Desktop auto-update goes through `@tauri-apps/plugin-updater` against a GitHub Releases latest.json (ADR 0018). The release pipeline lives in `.github/workflows/release.yml` (tag `v*` triggers: lint → tests → Windows NSIS and Linux AppImage/deb builds → publish-updater generating the signed update manifest latest.json → direct upload to GitHub Release). On a version bump, `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` (the single source; AboutModal reads the runtime version) and `frontend/package.json` are both updated."

